    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "I — the particle",
      "t_start": 11.47,
      "narration_text": "Here is the particle: six functions, each working beautifully in the lab. Gold core for heating, iron shell for MRI, a fluorescent dye, a drug payload, a pH-responsive release linker, and a targeting antibody. In mice, it works.",
