      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "III — two programs",
      "t_start": 123.68,
      "narration_text": "Two manufacturing programs. Program A: a single-function liposome, Doxil-style, ninety percent yield per batch. Twelve batches last year, eleven pass. Program B: six-function theranostic particle. Same per-function quality — but point nine to the sixth means only seven of those twelve batches pass specification.",
