      "beat_id": "B11",
      "act": "IV — endcard",
      "t_start": 159.28,
      "narration_text": "The particles that reached patients are the simple ones. Doxil. Abraxane. Radioligands. One function, well characterized, manufactured reproducibly. The elegant six-function Christmas tree particle stays in the paper. Simplification is not a concession. It is the work.",
